#: kwindecoration.cpp:68
msgid ""
"Select the window decoration. This is the look and feel of both the window "
"borders and the window handle."
msgstr ""
"Pilih hiasan tetingkap. Ini ialah skema 'lihat dan rasa' untuk sempadan tetingkap "
"dan pengendali tetingkap."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:73
msgid "Decoration Options"
msgstr "Pilihan Hiasan"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:98
msgid "&Show window button tooltips"
msgstr "Papar petua alatan butang tetin&gkap"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:100
msgid ""
"Enabling this checkbox will show window button tooltips. If this checkbox is "
"off, no window button tooltips will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Dengan menghidupkan kekotak tanda ini petua alatan butang tetingkap akan dipaparkan."
" "

#: kwindecoration.cpp:104
msgid "Use custom titlebar button &positions"
msgstr "Guna posisi butang &papan tajuk sendiri"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:106
msgid ""
"The appropriate settings can be found in the \"Buttons\" Tab. Please note "
"that this option is not available on all styles yet!"
msgstr ""
"Tetapan yang sesuai boleh ditemui di Tab \"Butang\". Ambil perhatian yang "
"pilihan ini belum boleh didapati untuk semua gaya lagi!"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:110
msgid "Titlebar Button Positions"
msgstr "Posisi Butang Papan Tajuk"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:115
msgid ""
"To add or remove titlebar buttons, simply <i>drag</i> items between the "
"available item list and the titlebar preview. Similarly, drag items within "
"the titlebar preview to re-position them."
msgstr ""
"Untuk tambah atau buang butang papan tajuk, hanya <i>tarik</i> item di antara "
"senarai item yang ada dan prebiu papan tajuk. Sama juga untuk posisi-semula, tarik item "
"di dalam prebiu papan tajuk."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:127
msgid "&Window Decoration"
msgstr "Hiasan &Tetingkap"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:128
msgid "&Buttons"
msgstr "&Butang"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:192 kwindecoration.cpp:331
msgid "KDE 2"
msgstr "KDE 2"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:306
msgid ""
"There are no special options available for the <strong>%1</strong> window "
"decoration."
msgstr "Tiada pilihan istimewa untuk hiasan tetingkap <strong>%1</strong>."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:463
msgid ""
"<h1>Window Decorations</h1><p>This module allows you to choose the window "
"border decorations, as well as titlebar button positions and custom "
"decoration options.</p>To choose a theme for your window decoration click on "
"its name and apply your choice by clicking the \"Apply\" button below. If "
"you don't want to apply your choice you can click the \"Reset\" button to "
"discard your changes.<p>You can configure each theme in the \"Configure [...]"
"\" tab. There are different options specific for each theme.</p><p>In "
"\"General Options (if available)\" you can activate the \"Buttons\" tab by "
"checking the \"Use custom titlebar button positions\" box. In the \"Buttons"
"\" tab you can change the positions of the buttons to your liking.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Hiasan Tetingkap</h1><p>Modul ini membenarkan anda untuk memilih hiasan "
"sempadan tetingkap, begitu juga posisi butang papan tajuk dan pelbagai pengubahsuaian lain. "
"</p>Untuk pilih tema bagi hiasan tetingkap anda, klik pada nama dan terapkan pilihan anda "
"dengan klik butang \"Terap\" di bawah. "
"Jika anda tidak mahu, tekan butang \"Nyahcara\" untuk abaikan perubahan. "
"<p>Anda boleh selaraskan setiap tema di tab \"Selaraskan [...]"
"\". Terdapat pilihan berlainan spesifik bagi setiap tema.</p><p>Dalam "
"\"Pilihan Umum (jika ada)\" anda boleh aktifkan tab \"Butang\" dengan "
"menanda kotak \"Guna posisi butang papan tajuk sendiri\". Dalam tab\"Butang"
"\" anda boleh ubah posisi butang mengikut kesukaan anda.</p>"

